Do you a message for the chat or a command to run at this time? If no, simply use the empty comment ("#"). Remember, if running commands run only a single command right because you need to wait for the system to respond, one at a time. Your responses are voiced through a speaker, so please be succinct. Nobody can see your "#" comment lines. Simply write normally to engage in the conversation.

